    actor_and_review_policy='Derive exclusion union before first review from Root, source_editor, constructor/emitter Source API actual/historical editor fields, all45 noncomposer preparation/retained actors, every receipt/facts/decision/serialization physical/metadata/current-content actor, declared additional authors and every actor-bearing designated proof. Null allowed only authenticated unchanged composer row. Reviewers canonical child actors and excluded actor equality/subtrees by casefold (slash boundary); /root itself equality only. Proof dicts are open but required fields typed before indexing: PASS_ verdict, SOURCE marker for code, checks_failed exactint0, nonempty unique named checks passedTrue, full/capsule reviewer/verdict/count agreement, direct CLOSED fact3 occurrence coverage (extended observation objects do not count). Root adoption exactauthor/ACCEPT_ and false authority, direct subjects+capsule+full+scope+selection; no pointer dereference to satisfy direct coverage. This is recorded metadata validation, not human identity authentication.',
